377
00:27:14,986 --> 00:27:15,993
Funciona de verdade.

378
00:27:21,914 --> 00:27:22,914
Segundo:

379
00:27:23,141 --> 00:27:24,141
E...

380
00:27:24,900 --> 00:27:26,333
